Dear Alba,

You may try next by using indices instead of giving mapply entire distributed matrices.

f <- function(id.x, id.y){
  norm(dX[, 1:id.x] %*% dY[, 1:id.y], "F")    # As long as dimensions are correct.
}
test <- mapply(f, 1:3, 1:3)

Sincerely,
Wei-Chen Chen

